{
  "repo": "HYDRA-UMC-ANOMALY-DETECTOR",
  "ecosystem": "hydra",
  "tagline": "Classical statistics on the spectrum of a signal: a baseline per series, a z-score per bin, drift and alarms.",
  "description": "HYDRA-UMC-ANOMALY-DETECTOR reads the telemetry of a series from HYDRA-UMC-DATALAKE, turns each window into a frequency spectrum with an FFT, compares every bin with the baseline of that series and raises an alarm when the z-score passes the threshold. It watches the drift of the baseline, writes its verdicts back to the data lake and publishes alarms over MQTT. It is a statistical detector, not a trained model.",
